@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Author" as U
participant "GitHub Issue Form" as I
participant "GitHub Actions" as H
participant "Router Workflow" as R
participant "Reusable Workflows" as W

U -> I: Submit plugin issue
I -> H: issues.opened / issues.edited
H -> R: route-issue-automation.yml
R -> R: classify issue (submission / update / verification)
R -> W: validate-submission.yml
R -> W: validate-plugin-update.yml
R -> W: verify-plugin.yml
R -> W: approve-submission.yml
W --> U: Status comment + labels
note over R: The router only dispatches, each reusable workflow owns its checks.
@enduml
